SUMMARY:The Sunday Kickoff — Tempe\, AZ
LOCATION:Varies each week around the East Valley. The Sept 27\, 2026 star
 t was the Panera Bread at the SE corner of Guadalupe and McClintock.\, P
 anera Bread\, SE corner of Guadalupe Rd and McClintock Dr\, Tempe\, AZ
DESCRIPTION:Pace: Social pace\, typically 15-17 mph.\nSchedule: Every Sun
 day. Start place and time are posted by Thursday each week on PMBC's Rid
 eWithGPS calendar. Usual start by month: Jan-Feb 9:00 am\, Mar 8:00\, Ap
 r 7:30\, May 7:00\, Jun-Aug 6:30\, Sep 7:00\, Oct 7:30\, Nov 8:00\, Dec 
 8:30. Breakfast usually follows.\nConfirm with the host before you go.\n
 https://cycleforchange.org/rides/tempe-az-pmbc-sunday-kickoff/
URL:https://cycleforchange.org/rides/tempe-az-pmbc-sunday-kickoff/
